t/recipes/checks/debian/patches/quilt/patch-systems-quilt-general

Filled Source tree from t/templates + t/skeletons, then build-spec overlay
and hooks (pre-upstream, pre-build). eval/hints is transcribed verbatim.
Source-tree Parity uses (source) lines whose extra is not a .dsc; other
processable types wait for those Subjects.

Hand-added after the fill: build-spec/diff/README is an upstream change that
dpkg-source auto-commits (upload-make-builder passes --auto-commit) as
debian/patches/debian-changes-1.0-1 (template description, creates README)
and appends to debian/patches/series. The importer does not replay diff/.
The patch header is abbreviated to its template lines, and the patch stays
unapplied so Source-package Parity can pack the tree.

